              "EZK.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.6.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jer 6.14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.8.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "8.11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Lunebi gumiyo jona guŋak woko kun giwacci, ‘Kuc tye,’ ento noŋo kuc mo pe. Jona gubino gugero cel ci lunebi gubino gubuko woko ki raŋi matar me buko kor ot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wac bot jo ma tye ka bukone ki rani matar-ri ni, cel bipoto woko piny. Kot ma corre acora bicwer matek, pee madwoŋ bicorre piny, ki yamo lapiru matek bicako kodo i kom cel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cel bimuk poto woko piny, ci dano ducu gibipenyowu gin aŋo ma wutimo pi buko kom cel ki raŋi matarri.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pi meno Rwot owaco kuman ni, “Abicwalo yamo matek cako kodo, kot ma corre acora bicwer, ki pee madwoŋ bicorre piny ki akemona ki kinigana, me muko cel woko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abimuko cel ma wubuko ki rani matar-ri areto woko pinyi ŋom, ci aweko te gutiŋe doŋ noŋo. Ka cel opoto ci wuto woko ducu. Man bimiyo wun ducu wuŋeyo ni an aye a Rwot.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Meno aye kit ma abitoyo kwede akemona i kom cel ki i kom jo ma gubuko cel ki rani matar-ri. Abiwaco botwu ni, ‘Cel doŋ pe matwal, kadi ki jo ma gubuko kome ki rani matar-ri bene gipe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kadi lunebi ma gubedo ka tito lok ma okemo Jerucalem ni kuc tye iye, kun onoŋo kuc pe-ni bene doŋ gipe.’ ” Man Rwot Lubaŋa ma owaco.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwot owacci, “Kombeddi in wod pa dano, nen mon ma gitye i kin lutuwu ma gitito lok ma gin tamo atama ki i cwinygi. Juk gin ma gitye ka titone-ni woko, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kun itito botgi gin ma Rwot Lubaŋa tye ka waco botgi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Can i wiwu wun mon ma wukwoyo lwit wutweyo i ŋut ciŋ dano, dok bene wukwoyo boŋo laum wic ma wuboyo iye lwit pi dano ducu kun wulubo kit bor pa ŋat acel acel, wutimo man ni wek gubed ki twero me rwenyo kwo pa dano woko! Imito tic ki twero me kwo ki me to i kom jona wek wuŋon giwu iye magoba ma cwinywu mito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Doŋ wutyeko pyeda woko i kin jona pi cayiri ma romo poŋ ciŋwu keken, ki pi kwon mogo matitino, kun wuneko dano ma onoŋo myero pe guto, ento wubwoto dano ma onoŋo myero guto aye gibedo kwo, pi gobawu ma wuloko bot jona, ma guwinyo lok gobawu-ni.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man aye gin ma Rwot Lubaŋa tye ka wacone ni, “Adag lwit ma wukwoyo i komwu me bedo ki twero i kom dano me kwo ki me to. Abicodo lwit meno-gu woko ki i ŋut ciŋwu ci abimiyo dano ma onoŋo wutye ki twero me loyo kwogi-ni gibwot gicito laboŋo ayela calo winyo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abiyeco boŋo laum wiwu woko bene, ci alaro jona woko ki i ciŋwu, pe doŋ gibibedo i te twerowu matwal. Man bimiyo wuŋeyo ni an aye a Rwot.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Wun doŋ wubalo cwiny jo ma kitgi atir woko ki lok me bwolo, kadi bed onoŋo an pe abalo cwinygi, ento wun wucuko cwiny jo ma gin lutim maraco, wek gulokke ki i yo me timgi maraco gular kwogi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
